        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grandma Studios</strong> proudly presents the next game in the hit Whispered Secrets series with, <i>Whispered Secrets: Poisoner's Masquerade</i>! <br><br>A highly respected guest of an extravagant masquerade ball mysteriously dies during the festivities, and you're called to investigate. A close friend of the victim is concerned not only about the circumstances surrounding the incident but also suspects that he may have been the intended target from the start! You'll have to be meticulous as you discover the truth through your investigation. Trust no one, and watch your back as an epic mystery unfolds behind the mask in <i>Whispered Secrets: Poisoner's Masquerade</i>! <br><br>This is a special <strong>Collector's Edition </strong>release full of exclusive extras you won’t find in the standard version. <br><br><strong> The Collector’s Edition includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love isn't always what it seems in the Bonus Chapter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock an added Bonus Feature with collectibles and morphing objects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay your favorite HOPs, find puzzle pieces, and earn achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy exclusive concept art, screensavers, music, videos, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never get lost with the strategy guide!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game - a sub genre of point &amp; click adventure. Follow protagonists on a story-driven quest, find cleverly hidden objects, and solve various puzzles to advance the plot.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grandma Studios</strong> proudly presents the next game in the hit Whispered Secrets series with, <i>Whispered Secrets: Poisoner's Masquerade</i>! <br><br>A highly respected guest of an extravagant masquerade ball mysteriously dies during the festivities, and you're called to investigate. A close friend of the victim is concerned not only about the circumstances surrounding the incident but also suspects that he may have been the intended target from the start! You'll have to be meticulous as you discover the truth through your investigation. Trust no one, and watch your back as an epic mystery unfolds behind the mask in <i>Whispered Secrets: Poisoner's Masquerade</i>! <br><br>This is a special <strong>Collector's Edition </strong>release full of exclusive extras you won’t find in the standard version. <br><br><strong> The Collector’s Edition includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love isn't always what it seems in the Bonus Chapter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock an added Bonus Feature with collectibles and morphing objects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay your favorite HOPs, find puzzle pieces, and earn achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy exclusive concept art, screensavers, music, videos, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never get lost with the strategy guide!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game - a sub genre of point &amp; click adventure. Follow protagonists on a story-driven quest, find cleverly hidden objects, and solve various puzzles to advance the plot.</p>",
